mate scientists expressed agreement"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":6,"Labels":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed that human-caused climate change is happening.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\nFurthermore, imagine you knew the following: Research conducted by the climate scientists who believe human-caused climate change is happening has been funded by highly respected scientific and government organizations, like the Department of Defense and the National Science Foundation. Additionally, many of these scientists have changed their personal habits to align with the research consensus and address climate change by doing things like installing solar panels on their houses, eating less meat, and switching to electric vehicles. Considering this hypothetical information, please indicate what you would answer for the questions presented below:<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\nConsidering each hypothetical level of agreement among climate scientists and the additional information presented above,&nbsp;<u>how likely would you think it is that human-caused climate change is happening<\/u>?","DataExportTag":"low ac trust","QuestionID":"QID90","DynamicChoicesData":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_509rzU4WBnjomFw","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID85","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed agreement on a survey on...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed agreement on a survey on a survey that human-caused climate change is happening.<br>\n<br>\nFurthermore, imagine you knew the following: Research conducted by the climate scientists who believe human-caused climate change is happening has been funded by highly respected scientific and government organizations, like the Department of Defense and the National Science Foundation. Additionally, many of these scientists have changed their personal habits to align with the research consensus and address climate change by doing things like installing solar panels on their houses, eating less meat, and switching to electric vehicles.<br>\n<br>\nConsidering each hypothetical level of agreement among climate scientists and the additional information presented above,&nbsp;<u>how likely would you think it is that human-caused climate change is happening<\/u>?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5,"2":0.5,"3":0.5}},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed agreement on a survey on...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Suppose you knew that 90.1% of climate scientists expressed agreement"},"2":{"Display":"Suppose you knew that 99.9% of climate scientists expressed agreement"},"3":{"Display":"Suppose you knew that 97.0% of climate scientists expressed agreement"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":6,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Extremely unlikely"},"2":{"Display":"Somewhat unlikely"},"3":{"Display":"Neither likely nor unlikely"},"4":{"Display":"Somewhat likely"},"5":{"Display":"Extremely likely"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed that human-caused climate change is happening.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\nFurthermore, imagine you knew the following: Research conducted by the climate scientists who believe human-caused climate change is happening has been funded by major corporations, like Tesla, which have a vested interest in a transition away from fossil fuels. Additionally, many of these scientists have not changed their personal habits to align with the research consensus and have continued to use fossil fuels, eat meat, and engage in, generally, unsustainable personal practices. Considering this hypothetical information, please indicate what you would answer for the questions presented below:<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\nConsidering each hypothetical level of agreement among climate scientists and the additional information presented above,&nbsp;<u>how likely would you think it is that human-caused climate change is happening<\/u>?","DataExportTag":"hi pro-consensus 2","QuestionID":"QID85"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_509rzU4WBnjomFw","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID15","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed agreement on a survey tha...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed agreement on a survey that human-caused climate change is happening.<div><br><\/div><div>Considering each hypothetical level of agreement, <u>what percent of the&nbsp;<b>climate scientists who agree<\/b> that human-caused climate change is happening do you think actually believe in their expressed view<\/u>?<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"init trust","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"4":0.5,"5":0.5,"6":0.5}},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine you knew that a certain percent of climate scientists expressed agreement on a survey tha...","Choices":{"4":{"Display