 there is a patch of mold. Every day, the patch doubles in\u00a0size. If it takes 4..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Configuration":{"InputHeight":29,"InputWidth":115,"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"CRT3","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"On a loaf of bread, there is a patch of mold. Every day, the patch doubles in\u00a0size. If it takes 4...","QuestionID":"QID5","QuestionText":"On a loaf of bread, there is a patch of mold. Every day, the patch doubles in&nbsp;size. If it takes 40 days for the patch to cover the entire loaf of bread, how many days would it take for the&nbsp;patch to cover half of the loaf of bread?<div><br><\/div><div>(only enter a number)<\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"On a loaf of bread, there is a patch of mold. Every day, the patch doubles in&nbsp;size. If it takes 40 days for the patch to cover the entire loaf of bread, how many days would it take for the&nbsp;patch to cover half of the loaf of bread?","QuestionType":"TE","SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"Selector":"SL","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"ContentType","ContentType":"ValidNumber","ValidDateType":"DateWithFormat","ValidPhoneType":"ValidUSPhone","ValidZipType":"ValidUSZip"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_509rzU4WBnjomFw","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID13","SecondaryAttribute":"On a scale from 0 to 100, how worried are you about climate change?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"On a scale from 0 to 100, how worried are you about climate change?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"prior worry","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},